      "side": 1,
      "message": "I suggest to add a Configuration field into the StatusHints instead of subId and create Configuration object according to subId by the following logic in TeleService. Then, StatusHints get the subsccription associated Resources object according to the Configuration object.\n\nWhat do you think about that?\n\n    private Configuration getConfigurationForSubId(Context context, int subId) {\n        Configuration config \u003d context.getResources().getConfiguration();\n\n        SubscriptionManager subscriptionManager \u003d context.getSystemService(\n                SubscriptionManager.class);\n        SubscriptionInfo subInfo \u003d subscriptionManager.getActiveSubscriptionInfo(subId);\n        if (subInfo \u003d\u003d null) {\n            return config;\n        }\n\n        Configuration newConfig \u003d new Configuration();\n        newConfig.setTo(config);\n        newConfig.mcc \u003d subInfo.getMcc();\n        newConfig.mnc \u003d subInfo.getMnc();\n        if (newConfig.mnc \u003d\u003d 0) newConfig.mnc \u003d Configuration.MNC_ZERO;\n\n        return newConfig;\n    }",
